15:07:02 Commands:
15:07:02   BEGINCFG ... ENDCFG        - add sensor config (multi-line)
15:07:02   BEGINCFG|k=v|...|ENDCFG    - add sensor config (inline with '|', supports \|)
15:07:02   BEGINRULE ... ENDRULE      - add rule (multi-line)
15:07:02   BEGINRULE|k=v|...|ENDRULE  - add rule (inline with '|', supports \|)
15:07:02   RUN / STOP                 - control sampling
15:07:02   CLEAR                      - clear sensors + rules
15:07:02   SHOW / SHOWRULES           - show sensors / rules
15:07:02   CLEARRULES                 - clear only rules
15:07:02   HELP                       - this text
15:07:02 
