15:07:02 BEGINRULE|name=GY511_MAG|source=GY511_ACC|calc=mx=s16be(0)|calc=mz=s16be(2)|calc=my=s16be(4)|calc=mag=sqrt(mx*mx+my*my+mz*mz)|when=mag>350|action=log:MAG change detected|ENDRULE
